        <h2 class="mt-20 text-3xl font-serif balanced">
          Privacy Policy
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          The protection of your personal data is very important to us at Causable GmbH. 
          Therefore we treat them confidential and in accordance with legal data protection requirements. 
          This privacy policy explains how Causable GmbH (hereafter: Causable) uses the personal data 
          we collect from you when you use our services. Moreover, we inform you about your rights with 
          regard to your data.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          Causable adheres to high standards of data protection when it comes to collecting and processing personal data. 
          We do only collect, store and process your personal data in accordance with the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (DSG), 
          the European General Data Protection Directive (GDPR) and the principles set forth below.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          This Privacy Notice explains what information Causable collects about its users and what we do with that information. 
          This Privacy Notice applies to the information that we obtain through your use of our webpage via a device or when you otherwise 
          interact with us to use our services. In this notice, when we talk about personal data, we mean any information that relates to an 
          identifiable natural person. Please note that we may amend this Privacy Notice from time to time.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-20 text-3xl font-serif balanced">
          What data do we process?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          Causable processes the following data:
          <br>_ Personal identification information or information that links you to a specific organization we work with (name, function, email address, postal address, if provided: phone number)
          <br>_ Payment information
          Please note that without this personal data we may not be in a position to provide you with our products and services.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-20 text-3xl font-serif balanced">
          How do we collect your data?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          You directly provide Causable with most of the data we collect. We collect and process data when you
          <br>_ Register online or place an order for any of our products or services.
          <br>_ Voluntarily complete a contact form, customer survey, or provide feedback on any of our message boards or via email.
          <br>_ Use or view our Linkedin presence.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-20 text-3xl font-serif balanced">
          How will we use your data?
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          Our company collects your data so that we can:
          <br>_ Process your order / mandate and manage your account.
          <br>_ Email you with offers on products and services you might be interested in.
          <br>_ Meet our regulatory and legal obligations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-20 text-3xl font-serif balanced">
          Where and how long do we store your data?
        </h2>
            
        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          Causable securely stores your data at our own premises within Switzerland / the EEA. 
          We have appropriate technical and organisational measures in place to prevent unauthorised or unlawful access to the personal data you have provided us with.   
          Our company stores your data for the mandatory duration to meet our legal requirements. 
          If you are no longer our customer and have not used our services, we will delete your data after this period.
        </p>

