        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-20 text-3xl font-serif balanced">
          Your data protection rights
        </h2>
            
        <p class="mt-8 text-xl max-w-xl">
          You have the right to require from us whether we process any of your data. 
          Likewise, you can require us to correct inaccurate personal data. 
          We are required by law to process personal data correctly. 
          Therefore, please notify us about any changes to your personal data through your usual 
          communication channel, so that we can keep your data current.
        </p> 

